{"id": null, "n": "0001001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照雜阿含二六（大正二．一八五c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照雜阿含二六（大正二．一八六a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含二六（大正藏二、一八六a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005002", "type": "orig", "text": "rādānuvādā gārayhā ṭhānā 如暹羅本作 vādānupātā gārayhaṁ ṭhānaṁ，下倣之，同語法出 Aṅguttara 1. 161. 10。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0013001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0013001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含二六（大正藏二、一八五b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0018001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0018001", "type": "orig", "text": "中阿含一〇（大正藏一、四八六c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0018002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0018002", "type": "orig", "text": "四大戒可能是四清淨戒，謂：波羅提木叉律儀戒、根律儀戒、命清淨戒、資具緣戒。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0019001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0019001", "type": "orig", "text": "同前。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0024001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0024001", "type": "orig", "text": "D. 33 Saṅgiti-s. 2. 1. xxv（漢譯南傳大藏八、等誦經第二誦品一之二五以下）集異門第一四（大正藏二六、四二四a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0027001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0027001", "type": "orig", "text": "離善量之法、出世間定之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032001", "type": "orig", "text": "七處三觀經（大正藏二、八七九a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0033001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0033001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含四七（大正藏二、三四三b）增支部六集第四十二章一、二節。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0035001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0035001", "type": "orig", "text": "暹本作 dve'gārav 為正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0039001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0039001", "type": "orig", "text": "偈文中阿含三七（大正藏一、六六〇b），前六句，雜阿含四（大正藏二、二五c），別譯雜阿含一三（大正藏二、四六五b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照增支部四集第三十四章。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042001", "type": "orig", "text": "adhivāsesu 是 adhivāsetu 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0043002", "type": "orig", "text": "ca 是取暹羅本之 c'assa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0044001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0044001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二四（大正藏二、六八〇c）同五一（大正藏二、八二六a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0046002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0046002", "type": "orig", "text": "dānani 是 dānāni 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0047001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0047001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二四（大正藏二、六八一b），七處三觀經（大正藏二、八七八a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二五（大正藏二、六八一a），佛說食施獲五福報經（大正藏二、八五四c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0052001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含四八（大正藏二、八一二b）增支部三集第四十八章。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0053001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0053001", "type": "orig", "text": "udānaṁ 是 uddānaṁ 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0053002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0053002", "type": "orig", "text": "有 thānaputtena，見前出之本文，可作如暹羅本之 puttasālehi。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0054001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0054001", "type": "orig", "text": "增支部四集第六十一章。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0054002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0054002", "type": "orig", "text": "據 A. 11. 684 之同文，可讀為 dāyādato vā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0055003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0055003", "type": "orig", "text": "hoti 之下暹羅本加 arippaṭisaro 為正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0056001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0056001", "type": "orig", "text": "七處三觀經（大正藏二、八七七c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057002", "type": "orig", "text": "hirimanaṁ 暹羅本作 hirīmanaṁ 為正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0058001", "type": "orig", "text": "「希求」之原語 pi hetuṁ（tum 是誤植），應作 pihetuṁ 以下亦同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061001", "type": "orig", "text": "在底本雖作 P'etaṁ 今暫依暹羅本單讀為 etaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照增支部四集第五十一章。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067001", "type": "orig", "text": "增支部四集第五十二章之偈，及相應部一一、二、四偈。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二六（大正藏二、六九七a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069002", "type": "orig", "text": "may' 是 mayh' 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0070001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0070001", "type": "orig", "text": "Kosala 者乃 Kosalo 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0071001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0071001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二四（大正藏二、六七九a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0071002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0071002", "type": "orig", "text": "雖取原典之 piyāpāyena 之讀法，譯者覺以暹羅本之 kālakatāya piyāya manāpāya 更妥當而取之下亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0071003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0071003", "type": "orig", "text": "kosārakkha 之語形不能無疑，通常為 kosarakkha，又「理財官」為現代一般之近侍者，相當於漢譯「恒與大王執劍」。想是王背後之衛兵，暹羅本作 sokārakkha，但其義不明，待識者之是正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077001", "type": "orig", "text": "netaṁ 者即 n'etaṁ 之誤排。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二四（大正藏二、六七四a）、雜阿含二八（大正藏二、二〇〇b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "（漢譯南傳大藏八、等誦經第二誦品一之一六）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0082001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0082001", "type": "orig", "text": "citaṁ 暹羅本作 cittaṁ，今依之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0085001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0085001", "type": "orig", "text": "cittaṁ 之次下，遺漏 na 字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0087001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0087001", "type": "orig", "text": "kathañ 在暹羅本及其他可採作 kiñ 以下准此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093001", "type": "orig", "text": "家之天掟，自古由祭祀守護神而來。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094002", "type": "orig", "text": "jīvitaṁ 由註釋文及文意推之，當讀為 jīvataṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106001", "type": "orig", "text": "dhammavihāri 是 dhammavihārī 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含三三（大正藏二、六八六c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109002", "type": "orig", "text": "itthi 暹羅本作 itthi 為正，以下亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109003", "type": "orig", "text": "samaṁ 取暹羅本之 sāmaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含三三（大正藏二、六八七b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0122001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0122001", "type": "orig", "text": "賊已作所作終者，取有情咽喉之血獻於神，若未作不作時，為所作之成效，如是謂豫作。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0127001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0127001", "type": "orig", "text": "親教師之旅行不在或死亡時，代其親教師名為所依師。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0131001", "type": "orig", "text": "sannidhikāraka 於註釋有 sannidhikata 但取異本之 sannidhikāra。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0131002", "type": "orig", "text": "「對地作麤相」是自掘地，又令他掘地。「對植物作麤相」是自伐草木枝葉，又令他伐。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0143001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0143001", "type": "orig", "text": "已知者，即所謂阿羅漢之智。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0162001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0162001", "type": "orig", "text": "vyattūpasevī 者，即參酌許多異本之語形，且亦依據暹羅本註，而採作 vyatthūpasevī 之形式。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0165001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0165001", "type": "orig", "text": "nipakkasatino 者於註釋之暹羅本亦作為 nipakasatino，今採通常所用之語形作 nipakasatino「常委」者，即恆常委細之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0171001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0171001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照增一阿含，三二（大正二、六八〇c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0172001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0172001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含三二（大正藏二、六八〇b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0176001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0176001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照 D. 33 Saṅgiti-S. 2. I. XI, XII（南傳藏八、等誦經第二誦品一之二）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0192001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0192001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照七處三觀經（大正二、八七九c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0205001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0205001", "type": "orig", "text": "七處三觀經（大正藏二、八七八b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0208001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0208001", "type": "orig", "text": "七處三觀經（大正二、八七八b）參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0220001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0220001", "type": "orig", "text": "中阿含六（大正藏一、四五四a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221002", "type": "orig", "text": "paripācetvā 於註釋有 luñcitvā（拔、裂）而依之，取暹羅本之 paripātetvā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0226001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0226001", "type": "orig", "text": "aññātukāmo 於註釋有 jānitukāmo 而依之，取暹羅之讀法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0226001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0226001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "中阿含五（大正藏一、四四九c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0230001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0230001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含一八（大正藏二、一二九b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0233002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0233002", "type": "orig", "text": "ti 之次下除去疑問符號。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0235001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0235001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含一八（大正藏二、一二九a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0237001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0237001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含一七（大正藏二、一二三b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0238002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0238002", "type": "orig", "text": "ti 次下除去疑問符號。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0241001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0241001", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本 pāṇātipātī 之語為正確。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0242002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0242002", "type": "orig", "text": "atimāteti 為非，atimāpeti 或應作 atipāteti，暹羅本為後者，以下[＊]記號亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0244001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0244001", "type": "orig", "text": "雜阿含一七（大正藏二、一二二c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0246001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0246001", "type": "orig", "text": "飼育豚、鹿等而賣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249001", "type": "orig", "text": "中阿含三〇（大正藏一、六一六a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0252002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0252002", "type": "orig", "text": "ca ārame，暹羅本為 ca n'ārame 為正確。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0252003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0252003", "type": "orig", "text": "以下之頌文，同增支部三集第五十七章。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255001", "type": "orig", "text": "pana 暹羅本作 pana na 為正確，以下亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0261001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0261001", "type": "orig", "text": "idam aṭṭhitaṁ 和前同，應作 idamatthitaṁ 以下亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263001", "type": "orig", "text": "Saṁsaggatthāya 者，在註作 sambandhāya，如依釋為 paveṇiyaṁ gandhanatthaṁ（為結相續之故）看來，則可採 Sambandhāya，故今從暹羅本等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0263002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0263002", "type": "orig", "text": "Samsaggatthāya 者即 Saṁsaggatthāya 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0264001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0264001", "type": "orig", "text": "中阿含四〇（大正藏一、六八〇b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267002", "type": "orig", "text": "於手澆水，為付與之表示。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267003", "type": "orig", "text": "此文之下有 sace Doṇa brāhmaṇo anutuniṁ gacchati（有頭那！若婆羅近非受胎期中之女者）之句在此處其義不順而可除去，若取用此句，而想下句有脫落者不可。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268004", "type": "orig", "text": "kuṭumbiṁ 暹羅本作 kuṭumbaṁ 為正確。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0280001", "type": "orig", "text": "5. 3. 2. 2. 12（漢譯南傳大藏一二、一四六頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0286001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0286001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照（漢譯南傳大藏八、三三第二誦品一～二四以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0286001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0286001", "type": "mod", "text": "參照（漢譯南傳大藏八、三三第二誦品一【南傳】，～二四以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0290001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0290001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二八（大正藏二、七〇二c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0291001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0291001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照 D. 33 Saṅgiti-s. 2. 1. XIX（漢譯南傳藏八、三三、第二誦品一-二〇以下），M. 16. Cetokhila-s（漢譯南傳藏九、一三七頁以下），A. IX, 71; X, 14。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二八（大正藏二、七〇三a）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0299001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0299001", "type": "orig", "text": "七處三觀經（大正藏二、八七九b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0302001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0302001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本二〇九，是二一九之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0303001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0303001", "type": "orig", "text": "增一阿含二五（大正藏二、六八八c）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0304001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0304001", "type": "orig", "text": "anulomikena 依暹羅本及註釋文之意讀為 ananulomikena。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0313001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0313001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為二是三之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0319001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0319001", "type": "orig", "text": "七處三觀經（大正藏二、八七九b）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0321001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0321001", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本為前品所不攝之經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0326001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0326001", "type": "orig", "text": "此 na sammannitabbo 之語，以暹羅本補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0326002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0326002", "type": "orig", "text": "sammato 依暹羅本讀為 sammato pi。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0326003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0326003", "type": "orig", "text": "乃至語，依前後文之例，由暹羅本補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0327001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0327001", "type": "orig", "text": "雖有乃至語，依暹羅本及前後文之例而省略之，以下亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041a0401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0041a0401", "type": "add", "text": "［－］【CB】，[01]【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0055a0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0055a0901", "type": "add", "text": "嗚【CB】，鳴【南傳】"}
